title: "Secure Student Records Management Control (SRMS)"
abstract: >-
  An educational database-security application that manages academic records
  while enforcing role-based access control, multilevel security based on the
  Bell-LaPadula model, inference control, flow control, and encryption. The
  project combines a Python/Tkinter desktop client, a SQL Server database with
  secure views and stored procedures, a Flask database inspector, and a complete
  security test matrix.
